---
import IntegrationCircular from "../../components/features/IntegrationCircular.astro";
---
<section class="relative">
<div class="relative max-w-7xl px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 mx-auto py-12 lg:py-[72px] border-t">

  <div class="mx-auto text-center"> 
     <h2 class="font-medium mb-4">Discover The Future of Retail Promotions <br /> with 99minds at NRF 2026</h2> 
     <p class="text-gray-800 max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-8 text-lg">
      Promotions shouldn’t be guesswork. They should be autonomous.<br />
        At NRF 2026, 99minds is showcasing an AI-powered automation platform that continuously monitors real-time customer and business signals to deploy <b>the most profitable promotion for each shopper—automatically.</b><br/>
        From loyalty rewards and store credit to gift cards and VIP perks, 99minds uses years of transaction intelligence to deliver personalized offers that drive conversions <b>without sacrificing margins</b>.<br />
        📍See it in action at <b>Booth #1006</b> — and experience what’s next in retail promotion strategy.
    </p> 
    <div class="lg:flex gap-2 mt-10 justify-center"> <div x-data="{ open: false }" class="flex"> <a type="button" href="https://calendly.com/99minds/30min" role="button" target="_blank" class="raise1 relative p-0.5 inline-flex items-center justify-center font-bold overflow-hidden group rounded-md font-medium"> <span class="w-full h-full bg-black group-hover:from-[#ff00c6] group-hover:via-[#ff5478] group-hover:to-[#ff8a05] absolute"></span> <span class="relative px-4 py-2 transition-all ease-out bg-gray-900 bg-opacity-0 rounded-md group-hover:bg-opacity-10 duration-400"> <span class="relative text-white">Book a Slot</span> </span> </a> </div> </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>